id=RNS_Hotspot
name=RNS Gateway
version=8.0
versionCode=80
author=Ahmed
description=Reliable voucher hotspot for this phone. v8: the admin panel and captive portal are now LIVE-VERIFIED at every start — a listener that does not answer HTTP is killed and restarted on the next working engine (compiled listener, busybox nc loop, nc fifo, busybox httpd), so both pages stay up after a plain reboot. The captive redirect is installed on every hotspot interface name at once and re-checked every 15 seconds. The staff panel opens on any device behind the password (ADMIN_GATE=1 restores the old IP gate). Vouchers expire by the clock, expired and kicked devices are sent back to the sign-in page, build your own packages, sell codes, read a dated sales report. Diagnose and repair with one command: rns-ctl.sh doctor.
